  "progress": "Since checkpoint95, the complete finite-cap, conifold, three-primary, cell, original-cap, local-Kummer, positive-Engel, weighted-profile and residual-even publication reviews were integrated with their exact defect rows and attributed used-and-rechecked events. The residual individual-wall correction has an integral map and inverse; its total class and every downstream invariant and smooth assignment are unchanged. L9, LA and THREE now have complete following subsection boundaries. LD and residual remain held at their unfinished successors. The whole later Kummer reading found a duplicated common proof, so Kummer D12 and structure were honestly reopened for consolidation; its heading was corrected to an actual subsection. Complete carrier review is read; metrics and final problems remain staged for joint placement. Retained-angle original source has been read in full, with its comparisons pending. The first checkpoint inspection stopped on a new metric-table CRLF; the writer and table were corrected to LF with all decoded fields unchanged, and the successful preflight was read. No new independent-check or PDF-page credit; III common references, programs, bibliography and final build/pages remain open.",
